  "id": "buffering",
  "term": "buffering",
  "definition": "In this psychology context, buffering refers to a protective effect in which one factor lessens the harmful impact of stressors or difficulties on outcomes. Here, perceived teacher support is described as buffering online academic burnout by directly reducing it and by strengthening helpful beliefs and emotional regulation around learning.",
